{"seq":1,"slug":"interest-feed-ranking","title":"兴趣 feed 排序与电商目标融合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-feed-commerce/feed-personalized-distribution/interest-feed-ranking","wordCount":3342,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"兴趣-feed-排序与电商目标融合\">兴趣 feed 排序与电商目标融合</h1><p>在推荐系统里加一个电商目标，看起来只是多挂一个头（head），实际会改变整条排序链路的形态。纯内容 feed 的目标是单一的——最大化消费时长或完播率；带货 feed 至少要同时优化消费、点击购买入口、下单、GMV 四条曲线，而这四条曲线彼此并不一致：最吸引人的内容未必带得动货，最能带得动货的内容往往让用户看得不舒服。这一篇讲清楚融合目标的建模方式、多任务结构的工程取舍、以及离线指标与线上收益之间的对齐问题。候选卡片是怎么被装配成流的在 <a href=\"../feed-commerce-model/feed-card-types\">短视频/图文/商品卡混排</a> 里讲过了，这里只处理&quot;给定一屏候选，怎么排序&quot;。至于这个目标倾斜到什么程度合适，是下一篇 <a href=\"content-commerce-balancing\">内容体验与带货密度平衡</a> 的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从单一目标到融合目标\">核心概念：从单一目标到融合目标</h2><p>最朴素的融合方式是给两个目标打一个加权和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>utility</mtext><mtext>content</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>utility</mtext><mtext>commerce</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score} = \\text{utility}_{\\text{content}} + \\lambda \\cdot \\text{utility}_{\\text{commerce}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">utility</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">content</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">utility</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">commerce</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个形式在工程上能用，但它的物理含义是&quot;用内容收益的单位去度量商业收益&quot;，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 一旦定死就隐含了一个强假设：平台永远愿意用固定比例的体验换取固定比例的收入。这个假设在真实业务里是站不住的——大促期愿意多换，DAU 承压期愿意少换，不同类目、不同市场、不同用户生命周期阶段的最优 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 都不一样。</p>\n<p>更接近实际的做法是把问题写成<strong>带约束的最优化</strong>，而不是无约束的加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>S</mi></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>utility</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t.</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></munder><mtext>eCPM</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>B</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>density</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_{S} \\sum_{x \\in S} \\text{utility}(x) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\quad \\sum_{x \\in S} \\text{eCPM}(x) \\ge B, \\quad \\text{density}(S) \\le D_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3717em;vertical-align:-1.3217em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">utility</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3217em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eCPM</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">density</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是收入目标底线，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是一屏内的带货密度上限。约束形式的好处是它把&quot;体验&quot;和&quot;收入&quot;的关系从&quot;兑换率&quot;变成了&quot;边界&quot;——只要不越过边界，内容目标可以自由优化；当收入不达标时，系统自动收紧约束去补收入。工程上的落地方式是用拉格朗日乘子把约束吸收进目标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>utility</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>λ</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∗</mo></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>eCPM</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(x) = \\text{utility}(x) + \\lambda^{*} \\cdot \\text{eCPM}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">utility</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eCPM</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;_&#x27; at position 10: \\lambda^{_̲}\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\lambda^{_}</span></span> 不是常量，它是一个<strong>按流量场景实时估计的控制器输出</strong>：当近期收入低于目标时提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;_&#x27; at position 10: \\lambda^{_̲}\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\lambda^{_}</span></span>，反之降低。这个控制器就是所谓的 PID 式预算控制，它的稳定性直接影响线上体验的波动幅度，参数不当会导致 feed 的商品卡密度出现周期性震荡。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>eCPM</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{eCPM}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eCPM</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的构成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>eCPM</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>click</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>convert</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mtext>click</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>price</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{eCPM}(x) = 1000 \\cdot p(\\text{click} \\mid x) \\cdot p(\\text{convert} \\mid \\text{click}, x) \\cdot \\text{price}(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eCPM</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">click</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">convert</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">click</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">price</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这两个概率必须是<strong>分开建模再相乘</strong>，而不是直接建一个&quot;下单概率&quot;（来源：阿里 ESMM 通过在&quot;曝光→点击→转化&quot;全空间上分别建模 pCTR 与 pCVR 并相乘来消除样本选择偏差，见 Ma et al., SIGIR 2018, <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.07931）。原因是点击和转化在特征上依赖差别很大：点击强依赖内容的视觉吸引力与创作者的粉丝基础，转化强依赖商品的价格竞争力、评价、库存与物流时效。合到一起建模会让内容特征主导一切，把&quot;内容好但商品差&quot;的错误候选排上来。\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.07931）。原因是点击和转化在特征上依赖差别很大：点击强依赖内容的视觉吸引力与创作者的粉丝基础，转化强依赖商品的价格竞争力、评价、库存与物流时效。合到一起建模会让内容特征主导一切，把&quot;内容好但商品差&quot;的错误候选排上来。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"多任务结构的工程取舍\">多任务结构的工程取舍</h2><p>工业界主流的结构是共享底层 + 多头输出（multi-task multi-head），具体形态经历了几个阶段的变化。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[用户特征/内容特征/商品特征/上下文] --&gt; B[Embedding 层]&#10;  B --&gt; C[共享底层 MLP/Transformer]&#10;  C --&gt; D[消费头: 完播/时长]&#10;  C --&gt; E[互动头: 点赞/评论/分享]&#10;  C --&gt; F[点击头: 点购物入口]&#10;  C --&gt; G[转化头: 下单/GMV]&#10;  C --&gt; H[负向头: 举报/不感兴趣/退货]&#10;  D --&gt; I[融合层]&#10;  E --&gt; I&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt; J[最终排序分]\">flowchart TD\n  A[用户特征/内容特征/商品特征/上下文] --&gt; B[Embedding 层]\n  B --&gt; C[共享底层 MLP/Transformer]\n  C --&gt; D[消费头: 完播/时长]\n  C --&gt; E[互动头: 点赞/评论/分享]\n  C --&gt; F[点击头: 点购物入口]\n  C --&gt; G[转化头: 下单/GMV]\n  C --&gt; H[负向头: 举报/不感兴趣/退货]\n  D --&gt; I[融合层]\n  E --&gt; I\n  F --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I\n  I --&gt; J[最终排序分]</pre><p>共享底层是必要的——四个头的特征体系大量重叠（都是同一批用户、同一条内容），拆开训练会让参数总量膨胀且样本利用效率低。但共享也带来<strong>负迁移</strong>：转化头的训练梯度会污染消费头的表征，尤其在转化样本稀疏时。常见的三种缓解手段各有权衡：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬共享（shared bottom）</td>\n<td>全部任务共用底层</td>\n<td>参数效率最高，稀疏任务受益</td>\n<td>任务冲突时负迁移明显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软共享（MMoE/PLE）</td>\n<td>多个专家网络 + 门控按任务加权</td>\n<td>缓解冲突，可解释哪类专家被激活</td>\n<td>参数量与调度开销上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分离塔 + 交叉</td>\n<td>消费与商业各一套底层，顶部做交叉</td>\n<td>冲突最小，迭代独立</td>\n<td>样本效率最低，特征冗余</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>大多数成熟系统的实际选择是软共享，因为它在&quot;缓解冲突&quot;和&quot;参数效率&quot;之间给出了可调的中间点（来源：多门控混合专家 MMoE 由 Ma et al., KDD 2018 提出，<a href=\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3219819.3220007；腾讯的\">https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3219819.3220007；腾讯的</a> PLE 模型在 MMoE 基础上进一步按任务分层隔离共享专家，见 Tang et al., &quot;Progressive Layered Extraction (PLE)&quot;, RecSys 2020, <a href=\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3383313.3412236）。门控网络的输出权重本身还是一个有价值的诊断信号：如果某个类目的商品让商业专家的权重异常高，说明这类商品的转化信号很强，值得单独观察。\">https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/3383313.3412236）。门控网络的输出权重本身还是一个有价值的诊断信号：如果某个类目的商品让商业专家的权重异常高，说明这类商品的转化信号很强，值得单独观察。</a></p>\n<p><strong>负向头经常被忽略，但它在带货场景里比在纯内容场景里更重要。</strong> 用户的负反馈不只是&quot;不感兴趣&quot;，还包括&quot;点进去发现货不对板&quot;、&quot;下单后很快退货&quot;、&quot;举报虚假宣传&quot;。这些信号必须进排序，否则排序模型会系统性地偏向那些&quot;点击率高、转化率高、但退货率也高&quot;的爆款型内容，短期 GMV 好看，长期信任崩塌。退货率作为负向目标的特殊之处在于它的反馈延迟很长（可能跨越一周以上），必须用延迟反馈建模的方式处理，不能简单地把&quot;样本还没回流&quot;当成负例（来源：延迟反馈建模的经典处理见 Chapelle, &quot;Modeling delayed feedback in display advertising&quot;, KDD 2014, <a href=\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/2623330.2623634）。\">https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1145/2623330.2623634）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>多目标融合层</strong>的选择决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>convert</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(\\text{convert})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">convert</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>utility</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{utility}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">utility</span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间怎么调和。简单的加权求和会退化成前面说的固定兑换率；实践中更稳的是分位数归一化后加权——把每个头的输出映射到同一分位区间再加权，避免某个头因为量纲或分布漂移而主导排序。融合权重按用户活跃度分层是常见做法：新用户偏向消费目标（先建立信任与留存），成熟用户偏向商业目标（此时已有明确偏好，转化损失小）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"训练样本与特征-带货排序特有的三个陷阱\">训练样本与特征：带货排序特有的三个陷阱</h2><p>带货排序的样本构造比纯内容复杂，因为一条样本里有两个实体（内容、商品），而它们的可用性随时间变化。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱一：用当前商品状态回填历史样本。</strong> 训练样本里的商品特征默认取&quot;这条曝光发生时&quot;的商品状态。如果实现上从商品表实时 join，就会拿到今天的价格、今天的库存、今天的评分，而用户当时看到的是另一个版本。这会造成严重的特征泄漏——模型学到&quot;低价的商品转化高&quot;，而训练标签里的支付价格其实是后来的促销价。正确做法是商品特征走<strong>特征快照</strong>（按天或按曝光时刻落一份），训练时按时间对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：把&quot;商品下架&quot;当作负例。</strong> 一条曝光里商品已经下架，用户根本点不进去，这不是&quot;用户不喜欢&quot;而是&quot;系统不该展示&quot;。这类样本要识别出来并从训练集里剔除，而不是标成负例。同理，库存为零、区域不可达、价格异常变动的曝光都要单独处理。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：曝光未点击的样本被大量误标。</strong> feed 场景里&quot;曝光&quot;的口径很关键。一条视频划过但用户只看了 0.5 秒，这算不算一次有效曝光？如果算，负例里会混入大量&quot;其实没被看到&quot;的样本，模型会学到&quot;展示即负例&quot;的退化策略。行业普遍采用<strong>可见曝光标准</strong>（如 1 秒以上或 50% 像素可见）来界定有效曝光，超出这个界定的展示不计入训练样本（来源：MRC/IAB 的 Viewable Ad Impression Measurement Guidelines 规定展示广告需 50% 像素可见且连续可见 1 秒，媒体评级委员会 MRC 于 2014-06-30 发布 v1.0，<a href=\"https://www.mediaratingcouncil.org/；另见\">https://www.mediaratingcouncil.org/；另见</a> Wikipedia &quot;Viewable impression&quot;, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viewable_impression）。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viewable_impression）。</a></p>\n<p>特征体系上，带货排序比纯内容多出三块。<strong>商品侧特征</strong>（价格、类目、评分、销量、履约时效、退货率）是转化的主要驱动。<strong>内容-商品匹配特征</strong>（关联置信度、内容里是否口播了商品名、视觉相似度、价格一致性）是带货场景独有的强特征，它们直接来自关联记录，见 <a href=\"../feed-commerce-model/content-product-association\">内容与商品的关联绑定</a>。<strong>创作者-用户匹配特征</strong>（用户是否关注该创作者、历史互动率、是否为用户曾经购买过的店铺）在社交电商里权重很高，因为社交信任是转化的强先验——这一块的技术细节属于 19_product-recommendation-engineering 的范围，本 hub 只强调它在带货 feed 里的权重通常高于在通用推荐里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离线指标与线上收益的对齐\">离线指标与线上收益的对齐</h2><p>排序模型最容易出问题的地方不是模型本身，而是&quot;离线涨了、线上没涨&quot;。带货 feed 里这类不一致有四个稳定的来源。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>不一致来源</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>处理方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>离线按 AUC/GAUC 评估</td>\n<td>离线 AUC 涨但线上无感</td>\n<td>改用与业务对齐的离线指标（如 top-K 的预估 GMV 加权排序质量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练服务特征不一致</td>\n<td>离线特征由批处理生成、线上由实时生成，口径漂移</td>\n<td>特征平台统一口径 + 线上特征回流入库做一致性校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈延迟</td>\n<td>转化与退货的标签回流慢，离线评估提前截止</td>\n<td>用延迟反馈建模，或对近期样本降权</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>竞价/约束层改写排序</td>\n<td>排序分最优不等于最终展示最优（有位置约束、去重、配额）</td>\n<td>离线评估要模拟完整约束层，而不是只看排序分</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一条在带货 feed 里尤其容易踩，因为混排的约束层（同屏去重、密度上限、卡位配额）对最终结果的改写幅度远大于纯内容 feed。离线评估如果只在自己复现的排序环境里跑，得到的结论和线上可能完全反向。可行的做法是把约束层做成可插拔组件，离线评估直接复用线上那一份代码——这也是把约束求解从排序服务里独立出来的另一个理由。</p>\n<p>线上评估则必须守住两条纪律。第一，<strong>换目标就要换护栏指标</strong>：只看 GMV 的 A/B 实验一定会上线一个把用户看吐的版本，护栏必须包含消费时长、次日留存、负反馈率、退货率。第二，<strong>GMV 的归因窗口要实验前后一致</strong>，跨期比较时还要注意大促与季节性的扰动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>内容-商业融合不该写成&quot;固定比例的加权和&quot;，而应写成带收入底线与密度上限的约束优化，用一个实时控制器估计拉格朗日乘子，控制器稳定性直接决定线上商品卡密度是否震荡。</li>\n<li>eCPM 必须拆成&quot;点击概率 × 点击后转化概率 × 价格&quot;三部分分别建模，合并建模会让内容特征主导并排上&quot;内容好商品差&quot;的候选。</li>\n<li>多任务结构在硬共享、软共享、分离塔之间取舍；软共享是常见折中，门控权重是有价值的诊断信号。</li>\n<li>负向头（不感兴趣、退货、举报）在带货场景里比纯内容场景更重要，退货率的长反馈延迟必须专门建模。</li>\n<li>三个样本陷阱：用当前商品状态回填历史样本（特征泄漏）、把商品不可售当负例、曝光口径过宽导致&quot;展示即负例&quot;的退化。</li>\n<li>带货特征多三块：商品侧、内容-商品匹配、创作者-用户匹配；后者在社交电商里权重显著更高。</li>\n<li>离线涨线上不涨的四个稳定来源：指标不对齐、训练服务特征漂移、反馈延迟、约束层改写排序；离线评估必须复用线上的约束层代码。</li>\n<li>A/B 必须带护栏指标（消费时长、留存、负反馈、退货率），且归因窗口跨期一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>排序决定了&quot;在给定目标下谁排前面&quot;，但目标本身倾斜到哪里才合适是另一个问题——排得太商业化会毁掉内容生态，排得太纯内容又完不成生意，见 <a href=\"content-commerce-balancing\">内容体验与带货密度平衡</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"兴趣 feed 排序与电商目标融合","id":"兴趣-feed-排序与电商目标融合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从单一目标到融合目标","id":"核心概念-从单一目标到融合目标"},{"level":2,"text":"多任务结构的工程取舍","id":"多任务结构的工程取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"训练样本与特征：带货排序特有的三个陷阱","id":"训练样本与特征-带货排序特有的三个陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"离线指标与线上收益的对齐","id":"离线指标与线上收益的对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"创作者带货与分佣","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-feed-commerce/feed-commerce-model/creator-commerce"},"next":{"title":"内容体验与带货密度平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/social-feed-commerce/feed-personalized-distribution/content-commerce-balancing"}}